  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "资源规划与建筑站位会解锁城镇设施之间的连锁效果",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "It will take a combination of careful resource management and planning to acquire the right buildings for your town, along with clever positioning of your buildings to unlock surprising and potent effects.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3892910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "异步PVP要求城市连续守住16轮，同时允许不限时调整布局",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As your town grows, other players will attack with their own skyshards, and you’ll need to survive 16 rounds to win. Sometimes they’ll surprise you with a humbling defeat, but that’s the best way to learn! With asynchronous PVP , there’s absolutely no time pressure. You can take as long as you like to arrange your city perfectly.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3892910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "170多种建筑分属不同派系，各自提供科技、爆炸魔法或生存能力",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You’ll encounter even more factions with 170+ unique buildings that have diverse and formidable effects to discover.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3892910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
